* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets. Declared rather than left to git's content heuristic: the
# heuristic gets fonts right today, but `* text=auto eol=lf` above means a
# wrong guess would rewrite bytes inside a TTF on checkout, and the corruption
# would only show up as a font that silently fails to load.
*.png binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
